Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:11.99,QuoteAttribution,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(950,0)\pos(575.333,185.333)}C.G. Jung
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:18.52,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,By the way, what've you been up to, Haruki?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:18.52,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:19.93,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,O-Oh, nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.93,0:00:23.32,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,Hey, if we put in positive \Nvotes for each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:24.00,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.31,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Don't talk about that stuff in the classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:34.84,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Damn it. This atmosphere sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.29,0:00:40.02,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Is it just gonna be like this until the vote?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.99,0:00:47.87,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Everyone's desperate to keep \Ntheir heads down before the vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.33,0:00:53.48,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Or they're trying to form cliques to \Npass positive votes between themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:58.28,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Maybe that's the only way after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:02.76,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You haven't mustered up the \Ndetermination to cut someone loose?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.76,0:01:05.63,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You're talking like Ryuen-kun now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:09.22,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You claimed that Ryuen's \Nattitude was false confidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:11.81,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,but it's your determination \Nthat seems false to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.81,0:01:12.89,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:16.89,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,So? What do you intend to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:18.66,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.03,0:01:23.54,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,My inability to contribute to \Nthe class is the result of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:26.52,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,my lack of faith in my own leadership.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:33.57,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,Brother... how should I face this?
