Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.61,0:03:20.67,Flashback,Hirata,0,0,0,,Could we meet up in the dorms this evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:23.20,Flashback,Hirata,0,0,0,,I'd like to discuss something with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:28.75,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,Hey, Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.57,0:03:31.64,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,On your way home?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:33.73,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Asahina-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:36.49,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,Not with Honami today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.73,0:03:40.73,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Ichinose and I aren't especially close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.73,0:03:42.27,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.27,0:03:45.00,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,{\i1}She{\i0} claims you're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:46.87,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:49.03,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,You're right to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.03,0:03:50.50,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,But that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.22,0:03:55.75,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,There's something I want to tell \Nyou about our sweet Honami.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.14,0:04:00.26,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,In the upcoming special exam...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:04.11,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,She asked Miyabi for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:06.50,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,President Nagumo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.90,0:04:09.63,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,They need twenty million points \Nto save someone from expulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.94,0:04:12.77,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,She's asked him to lend her the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.23,0:04:16.19,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,And what do you think Miyabi told her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:19.59,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Did he require some kind of harsh condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.66,0:04:24.32,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,The condition for lending her the points...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:27.51,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,is for her to date him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:31.90,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to tell me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.49,0:04:34.58,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,I'm doing it to help my own class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:38.34,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,If Miyabi lends that many \Npoints to a first-year,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:41.51,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,it could be a burden to us later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:43.02,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,And most of all...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:50.45,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,I'd feel bad for Honami if she put herself \Nthrough that to help out a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:54.18,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Why did you come to me about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.18,0:04:55.53,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:04:59.19,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,I just thought you might be \Nable to do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:00.92,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:06.11,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,It's like sending out a prayer \Njust in case, kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.13,0:05:09.22,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,Anyway, now you have the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:11.54,Main,Asahina,0,0,0,,You can decide what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:26.22,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Sorry to take up your time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.69,0:05:28.34,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm not bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:31.75,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Well, let's not just stand around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:33.68,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,We can talk in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.83,0:05:42.81,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,My, what a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:46.34,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,If it isn't the boys, Hirata and Ayanokoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:47.58,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Koenji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:52.83,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Rack those brains to figure out a \Nway through this exam, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.32,0:05:56.21,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,You never change, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:59.34,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,This exam isn't enough to change me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.77,0:06:02.11,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,While licking wounds with your comrades,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.11,0:06:05.78,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,see that you take out the unneeded trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:15.61,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji-kun, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:16.65,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.49,0:06:24.49,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,The year's almost over, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:29.43,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,We were sent to a deserted \Nisland, a training camp...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:31.62,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It's been a busy year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:34.42,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Yeah. But I've enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:38.33,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,And the class has come together so \Nmuch more than I would have thought
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:39.74,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,based on that first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:40.93,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:44.81,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Well... until this test started, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:48.12,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I thought it might be about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:49.33,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:53.94,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,I just can't think of a way around this test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:58.06,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,No matter how hard I think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:03.47,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Is there really no way \Nto save the entire class?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.35,0:07:06.13,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't think of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:12.13,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Getting twenty million points \Ntogether isn't a realistic option.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:14.29,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.11,0:07:18.92,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The only point of this test is to cut \Nout someone we don't need around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:23.81,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But Hirata will never be willing \Nto figure out who that should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:26.21,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Hey, Ayanokoji-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.41,0:07:31.10,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Do you think there's anyone in \Nparticular we can do without?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:33.65,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Not in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:37.50,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Whoever we lose, \Nwe'll just have to deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.59,0:07:39.90,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,You're very cool-headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:44.01,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,You're better suited to \Nbe class leader than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.47,0:07:46.69,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You think too highly of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.49,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,You're too modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.93,0:07:54.49,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,I've genuinely thought that since \Nthe incident with Karuizawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.94,0:08:03.21,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sorry to call you out at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.64,0:08:05.13,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Hey, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:09.23,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But it's unusual for you \Nto ask to speak with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.65,0:08:13.56,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I really wanted to talk to you in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:17.43,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The floor is cold, \Nso feel free to sit on the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:18.98,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:26.04,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,This is weirdly exciting...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.04,0:08:29.99,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,How do you intend to approach this exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.99,0:08:35.87,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Well... I'm still thinking over ways to keep \Nsomeone from being expelled, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:40.74,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I thought you might ask \NPresident Nagumo for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:42.75,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,What kind of help?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:47.79,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I doubt even Class B is able to \Nround up twenty million points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.65,0:08:53.38,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Which means you'd need \Nthe aid of a third party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.91,0:08:55.21,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.21,0:08:56.93,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Asahina-senpai told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.27,0:08:59.98,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Did she tell you his condition, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.35,0:09:01.27,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:05.23,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It's ridiculous, right? In all kinds of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.96,0:09:07.91,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.26,0:09:11.17,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,How many points shy are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.89,0:09:15.30,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,A little over four million.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:17.40,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's quite a bargain, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:18.87,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:24.26,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It seems absurd that Nagumo-senpai \Nwould be willing to lend me that much
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.26,0:09:25.78,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,just because I dated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:30.40,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Honestly, it feels like the kind of thing \N{\i1}I'd{\i0} have to spend points on to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:37.06,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I think this might be the only \Nway to save everyone in Class B.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.76,0:09:38.82,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.59,0:09:42.72,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,You're not judging me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.72,0:09:44.81,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I see nothing to judge you for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.42,0:09:50.72,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Though I don't understand why you're \Nso desperate to save one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.86,0:09:55.46,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I guess... you were worried about me, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.19,0:09:59.75,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm sure you think it's presumptuous of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:02.97,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,That's not true. It makes me really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:04.58,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:07.46,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It might be a little troublesome for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.37,0:10:15.30,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,If I hadn't talked to you, I might have \Nbeen able to make up my mind more easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:23.84,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Hey, Ayanokoji-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:26.19,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Are you actually pretty amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:28.75,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:30.90,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But that makes you even more amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:32.90,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Because you're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:36.52,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:41.54,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.65,0:10:44.10,Italics,Ichinose,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.43,0:10:51.55,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.55,0:10:54.42,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,What, have I ever lied to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.55,0:10:54.42,Main_Top,Mori,0,0,0,,Should we go together after class, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:56.45,Main_Top,Inogashira,0,0,0,,Sure, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.45,0:10:57.99,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:10:59.68,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Do you feel it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:02.06,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I don't think I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.87,0:11:07.44,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,They were so on edge before, \Nbut now something's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:15.89,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,A group consensus has formed \Non eliminating someone, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:19.57,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:23.45,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, \Nit did feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.45,0:11:26.29,Main,Miyake,0,0,0,,Should we have someone investigate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.29,0:11:30.09,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,No, sniffing around could result \Nin one of us being targeted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.09,0:11:35.47,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,You think the target might \Nalready be someone in our group?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:38.33,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,D-Don't say that, Haruka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.33,0:11:41.32,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,The fact that no one's asked us to \Njoin their consensus suggests that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:42.97,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,that might be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.23,0:11:46.82,Main,Miyake,0,0,0,,If they threatened you to help \Nthem or be targeted yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:47.98,Main,Miyake,0,0,0,,What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:51.12,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,I'd prioritize our own group, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:54.63,Main,Miyake,0,0,0,,Even if it results in you becoming the target?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.63,0:11:55.99,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:12:01.41,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,I just don't want to stay here so \Nbadly it's worth betraying a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:04.75,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'd never betray you guys, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:06.14,Main,Miyake,0,0,0,,Keisei?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:11.55,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,I theoretically agree with the two girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.55,0:12:14.00,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,But reality isn't that kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:18.09,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,"Embrace expulsion to help a friend" \Nhas a beautiful ring to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:19.94,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,but it would be painful to enact.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.05,0:12:29.50,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Hirata-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.73,0:12:38.60,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.60,0:12:40.66,Italics,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,We've got an emergency situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:44.59,Italics,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,The class is on the verge of expelling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.09,0:12:47.08,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Oh?
