Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.82,0:12:57.00,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,"Oh"? Did you know already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:12:59.04,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,No, this is the first I've heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:01.05,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,So how can you be so calm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.29,0:13:04.31,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Do you know how many intend to vote for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:05.86,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:09.85,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,It feels like close to half might be in favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:11.65,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.13,0:13:13.97,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Seriously, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.97,0:13:17.15,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I mean... you {\i1}can{\i0} do something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:19.28,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'll start to think that over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.61,0:13:23.00,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,You're such a space case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:27.49,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,They totally would've expelled \Nyou if I weren't here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.49,0:13:29.95,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,This kind of situation is \Nexactly why you are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:32.46,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,O-Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:34.79,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm glad you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.15,0:13:36.95,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.05,0:13:40.59,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, you'd {\i1}better{\i0} be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:42.47,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'll call you again some time later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.83,0:13:44.65,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,R-Right, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:49.19,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Is he really gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:58.61,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you might \Nask to speak with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:14:01.86,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I want to know who the ringleader \Nis in the plot against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:06.44,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I just can't tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:12.00,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who knows \Nwho it is, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:14.53,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,So that's how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.53,0:14:16.62,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,That's my Ayanokoji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:18.50,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,You already knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:21.61,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The ringleader talked to you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:24.51,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Then you used your people skills
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:28.10,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,to spread the idea among classmates \Nwho aren't close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:31.43,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,It was a hard decision for me, too, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:34.52,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,I don't want to see you expelled...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:38.91,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,But I can't betray the trust of \Nsomeone who confided in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:41.86,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I guess you won't tell me, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:44.53,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sorry to call you out so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.77,0:14:47.63,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Aw... You gave up that easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:50.24,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Are you gonna track down \Nthe ringleader yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:53.04,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. I probably can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:59.08,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Fine, then, I'll tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:02.80,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,The ringleader is Yamauchi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.77,0:15:05.00,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.60,0:15:07.30,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Satisfied now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.57,0:15:10.56,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The real ringleader is Sakayanagi, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:15.15,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,You figured out that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:21.47,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I doubt Yamauchi could convince you to \Nstick your neck out to play mediator.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:26.71,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,And Sakayanagi did come by \Nto visit Yamauchi earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.07,0:15:31.71,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Well, I {\i1}did{\i0} want to avoid getting \Non Sakayanagi-san's bad side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:34.28,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,This has been helpful, Kushida.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:38.41,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Do your best not to get expelled, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:50.16,Italics,Manabu,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.55,0:15:52.76,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,There's something I want you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:56.41,Italics,Manabu,0,0,0,,Very well. I'll take measures tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:57.75,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:12.99,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs16\frz343.6\pos(310,60)\c&HCFD4B9&\3c&HEBEEDF&\shad0}Horikita Manabu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:12.99,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs15\c&HE5E4E2&\3c&HFBFBF9&\shad0\pos(208,194.666)\frz342.1}You don't have any regrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.93,0:16:24.34,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:28.98,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,How long has it been since \Nwe spoke alone like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.33,0:16:31.64,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Outside of when I first joined the school,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:33.69,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,it would be three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.69,0:16:36.42,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I see. That sounds correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:43.45,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,If you're seeking points to help \Nyou in the supplementary exam,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.45,0:16:44.90,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,you're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.11,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:51.71,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I wasn't going to ask for... \Nthat kind of support.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:58.18,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Brother, please... give me courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.99,0:17:01.34,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,For this exam,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:04.25,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,everyone's either keeping their head \Ndown and waiting for it to be over,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:08.60,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,or desperately forming groups \Nto try to control the vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:10.76,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,In both cases,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:15.34,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,they're turning their eyes away from the \Npressure of choosing someone to expel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.47,0:17:20.27,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,But if we do it that way, \NI think we'll regret it someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:22.34,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,That's why I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:24.99,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I want to face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:27.70,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I want to face this exam head-on,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:29.95,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,and find an answer I can accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.74,0:17:34.15,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask you one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:36.44,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,How has your time at school been?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.35,0:17:38.50,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Enjoyable?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.09,0:17:40.54,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.29,0:17:44.70,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.21,0:17:48.58,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I genuinely don't know if I'd call it enjoyable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.35,0:17:52.16,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,But... it's not boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:53.93,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.41,0:17:57.85,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,It seems you've conquered one of your flaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:01.56,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,You never looked at anything around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.19,0:18:07.45,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,But you've widened your view, and \Nyou're escaping your life of boredom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:11.57,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,This doesn't sound much like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.89,0:18:13.95,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,What would sound like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.95,0:18:18.74,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,All you see of me is my \Nachievements and popularity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:24.73,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,That's because... you are my eternal goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.23,0:18:26.58,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Your goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.67,0:18:31.46,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,How do you see Ayanokoji, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.25,0:18:34.44,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,He's a classmate I don't particularly care for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:39.81,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,But... he's someone I want to \Ncatch up to and surpass someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.01,0:18:43.81,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say, but you \Nwon't catch up to Ayanokoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.81,0:18:47.81,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,That said, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.49,0:18:51.07,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,You should grow in a way \Nthat's more like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:53.11,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,"Like me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.57,0:18:58.71,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Are you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.73,0:19:01.64,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.25,0:19:07.13,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,In order to close this distance, \Nyou must take a step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:09.47,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:14.34,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,You are still naïve, \Nbut I will give you the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:21.10,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,So tell me what it is you \Nwant to ask your class.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:24.73,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.35,0:19:30.92,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,The supplementary exam is tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:33.86,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,You'd better not sleep through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:36.83,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,We'd never do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.83,0:19:37.86,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.86,0:19:39.62,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Dismissed, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:42.74,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yamauchi's strategy wasn't a bad one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.95,0:19:50.00,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,His one mistake was listening to Sakayanagi \Nand choosing me as his target.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.98,0:19:53.28,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Now, move, Horikita.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:57.26,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You should be capable of it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:02.51,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:04.99,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'd like a minute of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.02,0:20:09.40,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,What's this all about, Horikita-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:13.87,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,There's something I want to say \Nto you regarding tomorrow's vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:15.65,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:18.39,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,H-Hey, what's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.39,0:20:22.16,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Me and Kanji have plans to hang out, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:25.37,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Someone could be expelled tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:27.16,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Yet you're awfully calm, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:31.90,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,W-Well, I guess... \NI've made my peace with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:34.42,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,That's very admirable,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:38.16,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,but what I have to say only \Nmatters if you're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.43,0:20:43.05,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,These last few days, \NI've been thinking it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.53,0:20:47.17,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Who should remain? Who should be expelled?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.63,0:20:51.64,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,And today I was able to find the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.19,0:20:54.15,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,So I want to tell you that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.15,0:20:55.44,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Wait, Horikita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:58.07,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Nobody here deserves to be expelled!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.07,0:21:00.44,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Please allow me to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:03.57,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I had my doubts at first, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:07.70,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,The nature of this test means we \Ncan't even talk things out in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:12.20,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,It's become a battle to form \Ngroups to control the vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:13.33,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.33,0:21:16.71,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,As a result, there's a chance that an
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:19.68,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,excellent student who should \Nremain could be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.09,0:21:23.05,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,That wouldn't be any kind of exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:25.33,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,I don't know what's come over you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.33,0:21:28.34,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,but this is unexpectedly logical reasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.83,0:21:30.44,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Tell us more, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:32.84,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,About what you would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.39,0:21:37.23,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Normally, I'd like to talk with all \Nof you and decide who to expel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:39.55,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,But that would be difficult in practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.87,0:21:40.45,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Therefore...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.99,0:21:45.45,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I will name the person who \Ndeserves to be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.95,0:21:48.19,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.19,0:21:49.95,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,You're just going to confuse everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.18,0:21:52.47,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,We can at least hear her out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.47,0:21:55.06,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,I agree with Red Hair-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.21,0:22:01.21,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,The one I believe should \Nbe expelled on this exam...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.42,0:22:05.03,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Yamauchi Haruki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.51,0:22:09.97,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,It's you.
